"P435058039" "Katherine Stevens was a young girl in the wrong place at the wrong time. While attending Paragon City University, she volunteered for a Crey research project. A volatile serum transformed Katherine and gave her some feline features and characteristics. Adopting the identity Minx, Katherine lived on the streets of Paragon City until the hero Synapse recognized her potential and took her under his wing. Now, Minx is a full-fledged member of the Vindicators, and one of Paragon City's most promising young heroes."
